WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.069
A lower price can be tempting.

00:00:02.249 --> 00:00:03.935
But is it the same product?

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.699
One kit. Six kits.

00:00:06.879 --> 00:00:10.292
A different pack changes the decision. Check before you match.

00:00:11.453 --> 00:00:13.992
Cut twenty dollars across five hundred units,

00:00:14.172 --> 00:00:19.292
and gross profit falls by ten thousand dollars, at unchanged cost and volume.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:23.867
PriceBriefs reviews up to five public product pages.

00:00:24.047 --> 00:00:28.697
Clear source evidence. Prioritized fixes. And one agreed recheck.

00:00:29.853 --> 00:00:32.413
Make pricing decisions on the right product.

00:00:32.593 --> 00:00:35.537
Request your five SKU audit at PriceBriefs.
